    "ssky_text_column_QxLPEE": {
      "type": "ssky-text-column",
      "blocks": {
        "text_column_acQFD4": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "",
            "heading": "<p>Story‑Based Learning Beats Textbooks</p>",
            "text": "<p>Instead of just listing facts, our books are like interesting novels that draw in young readers with characters, situations, and dramatic events. They help children retain what they learn and stay engaged throughout the story.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_FUyyxY": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "heading": "<p>Philosophical Roots Brought to Life</p>",
            "text": "<p>Our books don't simply tell you what happened. They also tell you why events happened and how ideas like natural rights, consent of the governed, and individual liberty helped to create a new nation. These timeless ideas will spark deep conversations at home or in the classroom.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_XiPqtE": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p>Multi‑Format Bundles for Every Learner</p>",
            "text": "<p>Choose from:</p><ul><li>The hardback volumes alone</li><li>Audiobooks (best for kids who learn by listening)</li><li>PDF curriculum guidelines (which are great for structured school-based or homeschooling plans)</li></ul>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_p9WUNQ": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-4",
            "heading": "<p>Encourages Hands‑On Learning & Conversation</p>",
            "text": "<p>Each page encourages thoughtful reflection, with questions and natural pauses for family discussion. This opens the door to conversations grounded in timeless principles and deeper understanding.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_FKxJ4g": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-9b83f20c-1c44-44a7-9cd9-894083cef912",
            "heading": "<p>Designed for Families & Lifelong Learners</p>",
            "text": "<p>Parents love our \"Level Up Your Own Knowledge\" sections, which are short, deep dives into philosophy, context, and deeper meaning. These sections are for kids ages 5 to 12. </p><p>Everyone in the family grows together.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "text_column_KTmLzF": {
          "type": "text_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
            "heading": "<p>Built to Inspire Civic Engagement</p>",
            "text": "<p>These books give kids the power to make a freer world. Children are inspired to envision themselves as future torchbearers of liberty when they learn about past struggles for freedom.</p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        }
      },
